  "lectures": [
    {
      "id": "14689612",
      "title": "Working with Slots",
      "lectureOrder": 61,
      "videoOrder": 53,
      "sourceHash": "cc9c4e66c1cc9aba1b07f3549546b848795c3f391532fe698a111ec7c65076a1",
      "cues": [
        {
          "id": 1,
          "start": 2.14,
          "end": 3.43,
          "en": "We're almost done.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 2,
          "start": 3.43,
          "end": 10.33,
          "en": "But now I want to dive into a super important topic, a super important concept that can really help",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 3,
          "start": 10.33,
          "end": 15.4,
          "en": "you build more reusable components, and that would be slots.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 4,
          "start": 15.43,
          "end": 16.99,
          "en": "Now, what are slots?",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 5,
          "start": 17.5,
          "end": 26.95,
          "en": "Slots are placeholders in your component markup, so to say in your component HTML code where our components",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 6,
          "start": 26.95,
          "end": 31.81,
          "en": "parent components using your component can insert their own markup.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 7,
          "start": 31.99,
          "end": 35.41,
          "en": "Let's consider a modal component in the modal component.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 8,
          "start": 35.44,
          "end": 43.33,
          "en": "We just might want to provide a frame, maybe just the backdrop, and then the border slide box shadow",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 9,
          "start": 43.33,
          "end": 44.32,
          "en": "some padding.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 10,
          "start": 44.32,
          "end": 47.05,
          "en": "But we really don't care about the content in the modal.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 11,
          "start": 47.05,
          "end": 53.26,
          "en": "We don't want to force an opinion on the developer who uses this modal component because we might want",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 12,
          "start": 53.26,
          "end": 56.53,
          "en": "to use that modal component in many different places of our app.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 13,
          "start": 56.53,
          "end": 60.67,
          "en": "In one place we maybe want to show a sign up form in another place.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 14,
          "start": 60.67,
          "end": 65.18,
          "en": "We want to show a warning message, two totally different things, but the frame should always be the",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 15,
          "start": 65.18,
          "end": 65.84,
          "en": "same.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 16,
          "start": 66.02,
          "end": 71.06,
          "en": "And for that we can reserve certain slots in a component with a special syntax, which you of course",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 17,
          "start": 71.06,
          "end": 71.81,
          "en": "will learn.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 18,
          "start": 72.08,
          "end": 76.52,
          "en": "We could reserve a header, a content and a footer slot.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 19,
          "start": 76.52,
          "end": 77.72,
          "en": "Anything goes.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 20,
          "start": 77.75,
          "end": 79.55,
          "en": "This is the idea of slots.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 21,
          "start": 79.59,
          "end": 81.11,
          "en": "Now let's see how we use them.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 22,
          "start": 81.96000000000001,
          "end": 84.23,
          "en": "Back in our little demo project here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 23,
          "start": 84.24,
          "end": 86.88,
          "en": "Let's take the modal as an example.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 24,
          "start": 86.88,
          "end": 90.69,
          "en": "The button would also be an example, the button we used in the course project.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 25,
          "start": 90.69,
          "end": 94.28999999999999,
          "en": "And we'll come back to this button when we work on the course project.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 26,
          "start": 94.28999999999999,
          "end": 102.09,
          "en": "But now for the Modal, as I said, a modal could in its simplest form be all about two divs, one div",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 27,
          "start": 102.12,
          "end": 104.19,
          "en": "for the modal and one for the backdrop.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 28,
          "start": 104.19,
          "end": 106.53,
          "en": "And then we could add a bunch of styles here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 29,
          "start": 106.53,
          "end": 112.92,
          "en": "And here we have a class of backdrop and this is a class or an ID of modal.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 30,
          "start": 113.03999999999999,
          "end": 119.7,
          "en": "Then here in the styles you can bring in some styles that make up for a nicely looking modal.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 31,
          "start": 120.7,
          "end": 121.18,
          "en": "Attached.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 32,
          "start": 121.18,
          "end": 124.54,
          "en": "You find a CSS file with some styles you can just copy in there.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 33,
          "start": 125.45,
          "end": 128.48,
          "en": "This just makes sure that you should have a nicely looking modal.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 34,
          "start": 128.48,
          "end": 129.86,
          "en": "And with that.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 35,
          "start": 131.51,
          "end": 135.23,
          "en": "We have a nice container which could hold anything we want.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 36,
          "start": 135.44,
          "end": 137.48,
          "en": "Now, of course we could use a prop.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 37,
          "start": 137.48,
          "end": 139.22,
          "en": "We could then output.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 38,
          "start": 140.26,
          "end": 143.32,
          "en": "Some text here or some content, whatever you want to name it.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 39,
          "start": 143.35,
          "end": 149.86,
          "en": "Now we just need to add a script tag up there and in here we can export let content like this.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 40,
          "start": 150.13,
          "end": 154.16,
          "en": "And now here's our modal with the content inside of the div.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 41,
          "start": 154.18,
          "end": 161.11,
          "en": "Now we can go to the app svelte file, import the modal from the modal svelte file.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 42,
          "start": 161.29,
          "end": 165.1,
          "en": "And then here let's add modal like this.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 43,
          "start": 168.05,
          "end": 169.42000000000002,
          "en": "Self closing tag.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 44,
          "start": 169.43,
          "end": 173.99,
          "en": "And here content could be high and if we save that.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 45,
          "start": 174.6,
          "end": 175.71,
          "en": "Here's the modal.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 46,
          "start": 175.74,
          "end": 177.14,
          "en": "This is the modal screen.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 47,
          "start": 177.15,
          "end": 181.22,
          "en": "Let me actually add some padding to that modal here, to that style.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 48,
          "start": 181.23,
          "end": 185.43,
          "en": "So here, modal, let's give it a padding of, let's say one REM.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 49,
          "start": 186.18,
          "end": 190.97,
          "en": "So this could be our modal Nice, but we can't close it.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 50,
          "start": 190.98,
          "end": 192.15,
          "en": "You can ignore this for now.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 51,
          "start": 192.15,
          "end": 195.42,
          "en": "But of course, the downside here is that this is just some text.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 52,
          "start": 195.84,
          "end": 199.11,
          "en": "Now, of course, you could say that's no issue, right?",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 53,
          "start": 199.11,
          "end": 205.65,
          "en": "We learned that we can output HTML to all we have to do in the modal is we have to add at HTML in front",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 54,
          "start": 205.65,
          "end": 212.7,
          "en": "of this and then we can go back to the app svelte file and all of a sudden here we can start using HTML",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 55,
          "start": 212.7,
          "end": 214.32,
          "en": "and it will be output as such.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 56,
          "start": 214.32,
          "end": 215.31,
          "en": "And it is.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 57,
          "start": 215.49,
          "end": 218.36,
          "en": "But does this look like syntax you want to use?",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 58,
          "start": 218.37,
          "end": 220.53,
          "en": "Doesn't really look like that to me.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 59,
          "start": 220.56,
          "end": 225.27,
          "en": "Using or writing our HTML code here in the string and then outputting it like this.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 60,
          "start": 225.27,
          "end": 230.28,
          "en": "This is not only vulnerable to cross-site scripting attacks at least.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 61,
          "start": 230.28,
          "end": 234.75,
          "en": "Maybe it's also simply not how I as a developer want to work with that.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 62,
          "start": 234.75,
          "end": 238.74,
          "en": "And keep in mind that these components are there for us developers, not for the users.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 63,
          "start": 238.74,
          "end": 240.03,
          "en": "This is what the user sees.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 64,
          "start": 240.03,
          "end": 244.83,
          "en": "The user doesn't care how we build this, but we as a developer want to have a good time to.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 65,
          "start": 244.86,
          "end": 250.27,
          "en": "We want to write our apps in a way that is fun and easy so that we can focus on the difficult business",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 66,
          "start": 250.27,
          "end": 255.31,
          "en": "logic questions and not on the trivial stuff like rendering a modal here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 67,
          "start": 255.88,
          "end": 263.68,
          "en": "Therefore, it would be much nicer if we could actually use a opening and closing tags and simply add",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 68,
          "start": 263.68,
          "end": 268.6,
          "en": "our content in here just as we can do it for normal HTML code too.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 69,
          "start": 268.63,
          "end": 272.23,
          "en": "We can add a div with H1 tag in there.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 70,
          "start": 272.23,
          "end": 275.68,
          "en": "So why can't we do this for our own components?",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 71,
          "start": 275.83,
          "end": 277.09000000000003,
          "en": "Well, turns out we can.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 72,
          "start": 277.12,
          "end": 279.01,
          "en": "Let me get rid of that div first.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 73,
          "start": 279.28,
          "end": 283.84000000000003,
          "en": "We can simply add our content here between the opening and closing tag.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 74,
          "start": 283.87,
          "end": 290.95,
          "en": "But now you see undefined here and that simply stems from the content which I'm not setting anymore.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 75,
          "start": 290.95,
          "end": 293.8,
          "en": "If I get rid of that and also get rid of the prop up there.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 76,
          "start": 293.83,
          "end": 295.63,
          "en": "So now I just have the div here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 77,
          "start": 295.65999999999997,
          "end": 302.62,
          "en": "Now we have an absolutely empty modal and that makes sense because how should svelte know where to insert",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 78,
          "start": 302.62,
          "end": 303.7,
          "en": "this H1 tag?",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 79,
          "start": 303.7,
          "end": 304.54,
          "en": "It can't.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 80,
          "start": 304.57,
          "end": 305.59,
          "en": "We have to tell it.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 81,
          "start": 305.59,
          "end": 308.38,
          "en": "And that is exactly what we do with the help of a slot.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 82,
          "start": 308.62,
          "end": 310.81,
          "en": "A slot is a special HTML element.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 83,
          "start": 310.81,
          "end": 314.92,
          "en": "It's actually part of the web specification itself.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 84,
          "start": 314.92,
          "end": 316.9,
          "en": "It's not invented by svelte.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 85,
          "start": 316.93,
          "end": 321.52,
          "en": "If you took my web components and Stancil course, you saw slots there too.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 86,
          "start": 321.55,
          "end": 323.44,
          "en": "It's a normal HTML element.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 87,
          "start": 324.2,
          "end": 325.33,
          "en": "Use it like this.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 88,
          "start": 325.34,
          "end": 331.73,
          "en": "You add slot here can also be a self-closing tag here you can use both syntaxes here it auto formatted",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 89,
          "start": 331.73,
          "end": 333.62,
          "en": "it to a self-closing tag.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 90,
          "start": 333.62,
          "end": 341.3,
          "en": "And with this you tell svelte hey, any content between my opening and closing tags of this component",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 91,
          "start": 341.78,
          "end": 343.03,
          "en": "should go here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 92,
          "start": 343.04,
          "end": 345.89,
          "en": "Therefore now if you go back here is what you see.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 93,
          "start": 346.49,
          "end": 354.17,
          "en": "This, of course is extremely powerful because now you can pass any markup you want into your modal.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 94,
          "start": 354.17,
          "end": 357.14,
          "en": "This works and you can reuse that modal.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 95,
          "start": 359.01,
          "end": 362.61,
          "en": "Here is, uh, the second time with totally different content.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 96,
          "start": 366.05,
          "end": 370.91,
          "en": "Now they're just overlapping each other, but they are both there and you can pass in whatever content",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 97,
          "start": 370.91,
          "end": 371.12,
          "en": "you want.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 98,
          "start": 371.15,
          "end": 371.99,
          "en": "This could be a form.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 99,
          "start": 371.99,
          "end": 373.52,
          "en": "This can be anything you need.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 100,
          "start": 373.55,
          "end": 376.79,
          "en": "Now, let me get rid of that and just have the first modal here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 101,
          "start": 377.15,
          "end": 383.72,
          "en": "So these are slots, but you can actually do more with them than just pass in content in one place.",
          "zh": ""
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
  "errors": []
}
